            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kapakio nuatuboros nakeraar Saul ekabakawok, ibu ijo kitoloma kitolom da Isirael: abu EJAKAIT kotema jo atiar, ‘Itanyamenenei ijo ikatuŋa Isirael, iraun ijo ekapolon koIsirael.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
