        },
        {
          "text": " Kwaŋin kopotu imakio kere luka Isirael mama ejai ekabaka Keburon; kitutuk ekabaka Daudi kakes koKeburon kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT: kinyonyoikis Daudi akinyet araun ekabaka koIsirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
