              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Komany Daudi acebusian ka aŋor ace koYerusalem, kedau anyoun koKeburon: kourikinai Daudi icedwe lusap ka lupesur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.13",
