            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kepuput Ipilisitian ebe enyonyoikis Daudi akinyet araun ekabaka koIsirael, koloto Ipilisitian kere amoot Daudi; kopup Daudi, kijesar ore loabwaitai. ",
          "type": "text",
