          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakiŋisia Daudi EJAKAIT, kotema atiar, “Mam ilosi: kirimo kaukec, kobunoki kes kaneejaas ikito luka baka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejaun kwanata ebe, Kipup ijo eporoto loka lueraeete alosit kokuju kikito luka baka, kosodi konyet anyoun: naarai kapak kaŋipe kaŋin ŋes alomaria EJAKAIT kakonyenekon aidany ajore naka Ipilisitian.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswama Daudi kwaŋin, kwape ecorakinia EJAKAIT; kodany Ipilisitian anyoun koGeba kiton neidolio Geser.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.25"
            ]
